20:["$","$L1f","034",{"a":{"id":"034","slug":"niche-warming","term":"Niche Warming","category":"field-notes","kind":"guide","image":"current","tier":"canonical","evidence":"editorial","sources":[],"related":["native-posting","budget-of-learning","distribution-is-the-moat"],"fr":{"title":"Réchauffer un compte sans invoquer la magie.","dek":"Niche Warming consiste à explorer des contenus de niche dans l’application, avec des recherches, des vues et des interactions authentiques.","point":"Niche Warming consiste à explorer des contenus de niche dans l’application, avec des recherches, des vues et des interactions authentiques. Son effet précis sur la portée reste une hypothèse à tester.","body":["La préparation peut servir à comprendre les codes d’un public autant qu’à contextualiser un compte. Notez les sujets, créateurs et recommandations rencontrés. Une checklist de gestes mécaniques ne prouve pas qu’un contexte pertinent s’est construit. Comparez ensuite des comptes comparables et gardez les observations qui contredisent votre intuition.","Un carnet de préparation peut noter les expressions que les créateurs emploient, les questions des commentaires et les formats devenus banals. Ces observations nourrissent un brief concret. Distinguez-les du résultat du compte : apprendre le langage d’une niche est un bénéfice de recherche plausible, même quand aucune amélioration de portée n’est démontrée."],"action":["Définir la niche et ses requêtes.","Documenter les observations sans inventer une recette de portée."],"trap":"Aucune durée magique ni nombre universel d’interactions n’est établi ici.","quote":"Réchauffer un compte sans invoquer la magie.","stories":[{"id":"brief","title":"L’idée en trois écrans.","slides":[{"label":"LE SIGNAL","title":"Réchauffer un compte sans invoquer la magie.","text":"Niche Warming consiste à explorer des contenus de niche dans l’application, avec des recherches, des vues et des interactions authentiques.","media":"/images/current.jpg"},{"label":"LE CONCEPT","title":"Niche Warming","text":"Niche Warming consiste à explorer des contenus de niche dans l’application, avec des recherches, des vues et des interactions authentiques. Son effet précis sur la portée reste une hypothèse à tester.","media":"/images/current.jpg"},{"label":"LE CONTRE-CHAMP","title":"Ce qui peut tromper.","text":"Aucune durée magique ni nombre universel d’interactions n’est établi ici.","media":"/images/current.jpg"}]},{"id":"practice","title":"Du concept au terrain.","slides":[{"label":"PASSER À L’ACTION / 1","title":"Définir la niche et ses requêtes.","text":"À adapter à votre public, à votre budget et au périmètre de votre test.","media":"/images/current.jpg"},{"label":"PASSER À L’ACTION / 2","title":"Documenter les observations sans inventer une recette de portée.","text":"À adapter à votre public, à votre budget et au périmètre de votre test.","media":"/images/current.jpg"}]}]},"en":{"title":"Warm an account without invoking magic.","dek":"Niche Warming means exploring niche content in the app through searches, viewing and authentic interactions.","point":"Niche Warming means exploring niche content in the app through searches, viewing and authentic interactions. Its precise effect on reach remains a testable hypothesis.","body":["Preparation can help understand an audience’s codes as well as contextualize an account. Record topics, creators and recommendations encountered. A checklist of mechanical gestures does not prove relevant context formed. Compare comparable accounts afterward and retain observations contradicting your intuition.","A preparation notebook can record creator vocabulary, recurring comment questions and formats that have become ordinary. Those observations feed a concrete brief. Keep them separate from account outcomes: learning a niche’s language can provide research value even when no reach improvement is demonstrated. This distinction allows the team to use what it actually learned without turning the whole activity into an unsupported algorithmic claim."],"action":["Define the niche and its queries.","Document observations without inventing a reach recipe."],"trap":"No magic duration or universal interaction count is established here.","quote":"Warm an account without invoking magic.","stories":[{"id":"brief","title":"The idea in three screens.","slides":[{"label":"THE SIGNAL","title":"Warm an account without invoking magic.","text":"Niche Warming means exploring niche content in the app through searches, viewing and authentic interactions.","media":"/images/current.jpg"},{"label":"THE CONCEPT","title":"Niche Warming","text":"Niche Warming means exploring niche content in the app through searches, viewing and authentic interactions. Its precise effect on reach remains a testable hypothesis.","media":"/images/current.jpg"},{"label":"THE OTHER SIDE","title":"What can mislead.","text":"No magic duration or universal interaction count is established here.","media":"/images/current.jpg"}]},{"id":"practice","title":"From concept to practice.","slides":[{"label":"PUT IT TO WORK / 1","title":"Define the niche and its queries.","text":"Adapt this to your audience, budget and test scope.","media":"/images/current.jpg"},{"label":"PUT IT TO WORK / 2","title":"Document observations without inventing a reach recipe.","text":"Adapt this to your audience, budget and test scope.","media":"/images/current.jpg"}]}]},"schemaVersion":1,"publishedAt":"2026-09-08T12:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-08T12:00:00Z","author":"blackcurrent-editorial","media":{"src":"/images/current.jpg","width":1536,"height":1024,"alt":{"fr":"Banc de poissons argentés dans un océan sombre.","en":"Silver fish diverging through a dark ocean."},"credit":"BLACKCURRENT Studio","provenance":"AI-generated editorial illustration; original imagegen asset, September 8, 2026."}},"lang":"fr"}]
21:["$","$L1f","060",{"a":{"id":"060","slug":"matched-cohorts","term":"Matched cohorts","category":"lab","kind":"protocol","image":"iceberg","tier":"operating","evidence":"hypothesis","sources":[],"related":["posting-time-myth","top-ten-accounts","distribution-is-the-moat"],"fr":{"title":"Comparer ce qui peut vraiment l’être.","dek":"Une cohorte appariée rapproche des observations sur des caractéristiques connues.","point":"Une cohorte appariée rapproche des observations sur des caractéristiques connues. Elle réduit certaines différences visibles sans éliminer automatiquement tous les facteurs de confusion.","body":["Pour comparer des modes de publication, commencez par format, marché, âge de compte et fenêtre de mesure. Conservez les cas sans équivalent plutôt que de forcer des paires absurdes. Les variables non observées restent une limite. Une comparaison appariée doit dire pourquoi ses groupes sont crédibles, pas seulement afficher un écart.","Consignez les cas exclus et leur profil. Si seuls les comptes les plus simples à comparer restent dans l’étude, la conclusion peut ne pas s’appliquer au réseau entier. Une méthode reproductible permet à un autre lecteur de comprendre exactement la population couverte. La transparence sur les limites vaut mieux qu’un échantillon artificiellement présenté comme universel."],"action":["Choisir les variables d’appariement avant analyse.","Publier les exclusions et la couverture."],"trap":"Un appariement n’est pas une randomisation et ne suffit pas à prouver la causalité.","quote":"Comparer ce qui peut vraiment l’être.","stories":[{"id":"brief","title":"L’idée en trois écrans.","slides":[{"label":"LE SIGNAL","title":"Comparer ce qui peut vraiment l’être.","text":"Une cohorte appariée rapproche des observations sur des caractéristiques connues.","media":"/images/iceberg.jpg"},{"label":"LE CONCEPT","title":"Matched cohorts","text":"Une cohorte appariée rapproche des observations sur des caractéristiques connues. Elle réduit certaines différences visibles sans éliminer automatiquement tous les facteurs de confusion.","media":"/images/iceberg.jpg"},{"label":"LE CONTRE-CHAMP","title":"Ce qui peut tromper.","text":"Un appariement n’est pas une randomisation et ne suffit pas à prouver la causalité.","media":"/images/iceberg.jpg"}]},{"id":"practice","title":"Du concept au terrain.","slides":[{"label":"PASSER À L’ACTION / 1","title":"Choisir les variables d’appariement avant analyse.","text":"À adapter à votre public, à votre budget et au périmètre de votre test.","media":"/images/iceberg.jpg"},{"label":"PASSER À L’ACTION / 2","title":"Publier les exclusions et la couverture.","text":"À adapter à votre public, à votre budget et au périmètre de votre test.","media":"/images/iceberg.jpg"}]}]},"en":{"title":"Compare what is actually comparable.","dek":"A matched cohort aligns observations on known characteristics.","point":"A matched cohort aligns observations on known characteristics. It reduces some visible differences without automatically eliminating all confounding.","body":["For publishing-method comparisons, start with format, market, account age and measurement window. Retain unmatched cases separately rather than forcing implausible pairs. Unobserved variables remain a limitation. A matched comparison must explain group credibility, not merely display a gap.","Record excluded cases and their characteristics. If only the easiest accounts to compare remain, conclusions may not apply to the full network. A reproducible method lets another reader understand the population actually covered. Transparency about limits is more useful than presenting a selected sample as universal. The comparison can remain valuable, provided the claim stays inside the boundaries of the observations that support it."],"action":["Choose matching variables before analysis.","Publish exclusions and coverage."],"trap":"Matching is not randomization and does not establish causality by itself.","quote":"Compare what is actually comparable.","stories":[{"id":"brief","title":"The idea in three screens.","slides":[{"label":"THE SIGNAL","title":"Compare what is actually comparable.","text":"A matched cohort aligns observations on known characteristics.","media":"/images/iceberg.jpg"},{"label":"THE CONCEPT","title":"Matched cohorts","text":"A matched cohort aligns observations on known characteristics. It reduces some visible differences without automatically eliminating all confounding.","media":"/images/iceberg.jpg"},{"label":"THE OTHER SIDE","title":"What can mislead.","text":"Matching is not randomization and does not establish causality by itself.","media":"/images/iceberg.jpg"}]},{"id":"practice","title":"From concept to practice.","slides":[{"label":"PUT IT TO WORK / 1","title":"Choose matching variables before analysis.","text":"Adapt this to your audience, budget and test scope.","media":"/images/iceberg.jpg"},{"label":"PUT IT TO WORK / 2","title":"Publish exclusions and coverage.","text":"Adapt this to your audience, budget and test scope.","media":"/images/iceberg.jpg"}]}]},"schemaVersion":1,"publishedAt":"2026-09-08T12:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-08T12:00:00Z","author":"blackcurrent-editorial","media":{"src":"/images/iceberg.jpg","width":1536,"height":1024,"alt":{"fr":"Iceberg nocturne et masse immergée verte, métaphore de la distribution invisible.","en":"Night iceberg with a green submerged mass, a metaphor for unseen distribution."},"credit":"BLACKCURRENT Studio","provenance":"AI-generated editorial illustration; original imagegen asset, September 8, 2026."}},"lang":"fr"}]
